  "artifact_text": "### Observations\n\n1. Deployment `notifications-worker` was updated to version 2.0.0 via deployment change `CI-2459` at 2026-10-23T08:24:18Z.\n2. The deployment `notifications-worker` container environment specifies optional `secretKeyRef` key `SMTP_PASSWORD` from secret `notifications-smtp`.\n3. Pod `notifications-worker-6784d8b8df-lk5l8` log states `ERROR notifications-worker: missing required setting SMTP_PASSWORD (environment variable is unset or empty)` and exits with status 1.\n\n### Leads Ruled Out\n\n1. OOMKilled or resource constraint failure was ruled out because the pod terminated with exit code 1 due to configuration error, not OOM.\n2. Network dependency unreachable was ruled out because the application terminated during startup configuration validation before establishing network connections.\n\n### Root Cause\n\nThe v2.0.0 release requires `SMTP_PASSWORD` in the environment, but the referenced Kubernetes secret `notifications-smtp` lacks this key or is empty.\n\n### Recommended Action\n\nThe notifications team should populate the `SMTP_PASSWORD` key inside secret `notifications-smtp` in namespace `demo-apps` or provide the environment variable.",
